%% Sequence 05 overview — List organization members
%% Updated: 2026-07-27.
%% Scenario: organization owner/admin opens member list in admin shell.
%% Evidence status: Implemented.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Organization owner / admin
    participant B as «boundary» Browser
    participant C as «boundary» ListMembersController
    participant Q as «control» GetOrganizationMembersIndexPageQuery
    participant D as «entity» PostgreSQL

    U->>B: Open organization members
    activate B
    B->>C: GET /org/members
    activate C
    alt Auth/org context missing
        C-->>B: Render login/no-org surface
    else Context resolved by route middleware
        C->>Q: execute(organizationId, filters, pagination)
        activate Q
        Q->>D: Read organization members and role/status aggregates
        activate D
        D-->>Q: Member page and stats
        deactivate D
        Q-->>C: Page data
        deactivate Q
        C-->>B: Render org/members/index
    end
    deactivate C
    B-->>U: Show members or context recovery
    deactivate B
